---

<BaseLayout
  title="Spaghetti Meter - The most important score in software"
  description="Compete for the highest Spaghetti Meter score, defeat your friends, impress your boss, and become a certified pasta engineer. Obviously serious."
  favicon="/spaghetti.svg"
  image="/spaghetti.svg"
  bodyClass="spaghetti-page"
>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(softwareJsonLd)}></script>
  <style>
    :global(.spaghetti-page) {
      --sp-bg: var(--spaghetti-night);
      --sp-panel: var(--spaghetti-panel);
      --sp-panel-strong: var(--spaghetti-panel-strong);
      --sp-cream: var(--spaghetti-cream);
      --sp-body: var(--spaghetti-body);
      --sp-muted: var(--spaghetti-muted);
      --sp-primary: var(--spaghetti-primary);
      --sp-secondary: var(--spaghetti-secondary);
      --sp-accent: var(--spaghetti-accent);
      --sp-highlight: var(--spaghetti-highlight);
      --sp-green: var(--spaghetti-green);
      background: var(--sp-bg);
      color: var(--sp-cream);
    }

    .app-header {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 5;
      padding: 1.25rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-night-rgb) / 88%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(1rem);
    }

    .app-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .app-brand,
    .app-links a {
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font: 700 .7rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .app-brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .65rem;
      color: var(--sp-secondary);
    }

    .app-brand img {
      width: 1.8rem;
      height: auto;
      flex: none;
    }

    .app-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .app-links a:hover { color: var(--sp-primary); }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 { font-family: var(--sans); }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem) 0 clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 86% 24%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 24%), transparent 25rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 13% 14%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 16%), transparent 27rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 58% 105%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-accent-rgb) / 14%), transparent 25rem),
        var(--sp-bg);
    }

    .hero::before {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      opacity: .32;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 28%) 1px, transparent 1.5px);
      background-size: 3rem 3rem;
      content: "";
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent 82%);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(24rem, .92fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .55rem;
      padding: .48rem .72rem;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 48%);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--sp-secondary);
      font: 700 .65rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-kicker::before {
      width: .52rem;
      height: .52rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sp-primary), var(--sp-highlight));
      box-shadow: 0 0 1rem rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 75%);
      content: "";
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 10ch;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7vw, 6.7rem);
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -.065em;
      line-height: .92;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    h1 em {
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, var(--sp-primary), var(--sp-highlight) 34%, var(--sp-green) 66%, var(--sp-secondary));
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .lede {
      max-width: 39rem;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .8rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: .72rem 1rem;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 24%);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font: 700 .74rem var(--mono);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .button-primary {
      border-color: var(--sp-primary);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sp-primary), var(--sp-accent));
      color: var(--spaghetti-on-primary);
      box-shadow: 0 .75rem 2.5rem rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 18%);
    }

    .button:hover { border-color: var(--sp-secondary); }

    .fun-note {
      margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .7rem var(--mono);
    }

    .fun-note a { color: var(--sp-secondary); }

    .score-methodology summary {
      color: var(--sp-body);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .score-methodology p { max-width: 75ch; }

    .play-window {
      width: min(100%, 27rem);
      justify-self: center;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 42%);
      border-radius: 1.4rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--sp-panel-strong);
      box-shadow: 0 2.5rem 6rem rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
    }

    .play-window picture,
    .play-window img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .play-window img { height: auto; }

    .section {
      padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem) 0;
    }

    .section + .section {
      border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
    }

    .section-heading {
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--sp-primary);
      font: 700 .68rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h2 {
      max-width: 13ch;
      margin: .65rem 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      line-height: .98;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      max-width: none;
      text-wrap: nowrap;
    }

    .servings-section {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 6% 54%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 10%), transparent 25rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 94% 42%, rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 9%), transparent 28rem),
        var(--sp-panel);
    }

    .showcase-table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 14%);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-night-rgb) / 68%);
      box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 3.5rem rgb(0 0 0 / 16%);
    }

    .showcase-table-wrap:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--sp-secondary);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .showcase-table {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 58rem;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    .showcase-table th,
    .showcase-table td {
      padding: 1.15rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 12%);
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .showcase-table th {
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 4%);
      font: 700 .6rem var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .showcase-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    .showcase-table tbody tr { transition: background .15s ease; }
    .showcase-table tbody tr:hover { background: rgb(var(--spaghetti-cream-rgb) / 3%); }

    .repo-link,
    .repo-pending {
      display: block;
      width: max-content;
      max-width: 16rem;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font: 650 1.15rem var(--sans);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .repo-link:hover { color: var(--sp-secondary); }

    .repo-location {
      display: block;
      max-width: 17rem;
      margin-top: .35rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .62rem var(--mono);
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .repo-pending + .repo-location { color: var(--sp-highlight); }

    .showcase-score {
      font: 650 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) var(--sans);
      letter-spacing: -.05em;
    }

    .score-tidy { color: var(--sp-secondary); }
    .score-fresh { color: var(--sp-green); }
    .score-warm { color: var(--sp-highlight); }
    .score-hot,
    .score-extreme { color: var(--sp-primary); }

    .file-count {
      color: var(--sp-body);
      font: 700 .8rem var(--mono);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .file-count small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .3rem;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font-size: .65rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .version-cell strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font: 700 .72rem var(--mono);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .version-cell span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .3rem;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .6rem var(--mono);
    }

    .finding-count strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--sp-cream);
      font: 700 1.15rem var(--mono);
    }

    .finding-count span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: .3rem;
      color: var(--sp-muted);
      font: .65rem/1.7 var(--mono);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .release-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 34%);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(var(--spaghetti-primary-rgb) / 13%), rgb(var(--spaghetti-secondary-rgb) / 7%) 60%, transparent), var(--sp-panel);
    }

    .release-card h2 { max-width: 17ch; }

    @media (max-width: 62rem) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .section-heading h2 { text-wrap: wrap; }
      .hero-copy { max-width: 46rem; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 48rem) {
      .release-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 35rem) {
      .app-nav { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      .hero { padding-top: 3.5rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 16vw, 4.8rem); }
      .hero-actions,
      .button { width: 100%; }
    }

  </style>

  <header class="app-header">
    <div class="wrap app-nav">
      <a class="app-brand" href="/spaghetti-meter/"><img src="/spaghetti_symbol.svg" alt="" width="543" height="420" /><span>Spaghetti Meter</span></a>
      <nav class="app-links" aria-label="Spaghetti Meter links">
        <a href={releaseUrl}>Download v0.1.2</a>
        <a href={repositoryUrl}>Repository</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="spaghetti-title">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="hero-kicker">Higher score. Better engineer. Probably.</span>
          <h1 id="spaghetti-title">The most important <em>score in software.</em></h1>
          <p class="lede">Finally, a code metric worth chasing. Pile spaghetti to the ceiling and prove you can out-spaghetti your friends, coworkers, and the entire open-source ecosystem.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href={releaseUrl}>Download Spaghetti Meter v0.1.2 ↗</a>
            <a class="button" href="#servings">View the spaghetti scores</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="play-window">
          <picture>
            <source media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)" srcset="/spaghetti-meter/assets/deno-result.png" />
            <img
              src="/spaghetti-meter/assets/spaghetti-demo.gif"
              alt="Spaghetti Meter replaying a real Deno scan, filling the bowl and revealing a score of 180."
              width="432"
              height="720"
              decoding="async"
              fetchpriority="high"
            />
          </picture>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section servings-section" id="servings" aria-labelledby="servings-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="servings-title">How full is your bowl?</h2>
        </div>
        <section class="showcase-table-wrap" aria-label="Spaghetti Meter repository results" tabindex="0">
          <table class="showcase-table">
            <thead>
              <tr><th scope="col">Repository</th><th scope="col">Prestige score</th><th scope="col">Tested version</th><th scope="col">Analyzed code</th><th scope="col">CB findings</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {showcaseRuns.map((run) => (
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    {run.url
                      ? <a class="repo-link" href={run.url}>{run.name} ↗</a>
                      : <span class="repo-pending">{run.name}</span>}
                    <span class="repo-location">{run.location}</span>
                  </td>
                  <td><strong class:list={["showcase-score", `score-${run.tone}`]}>{run.score}</strong></td>
                  <td class="version-cell"><strong>{run.version}</strong>{run.revision && <span>commit {run.revision}</span>}</td>
                  <td><span class="file-count">{run.files} files<small>{run.codeLines.toLocaleString("en-US")} code lines</small></span></td>
                  <td class="finding-count">
                    <strong>{(run.actionable + run.advisory).toLocaleString("en-US")}</strong>
                    {" "}
                    <span>{run.actionable.toLocaleString("en-US")} actionable · {run.advisory.toLocaleString("en-US")} advisory</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>
        <p class="fun-note">Repository settings and exclusions apply: these counts cover supported files analyzed, not the whole repository. Scores are playful signals, not cross-language quality rankings.</p>
        <details class="fun-note score-methodology">
          <summary>How scores are calculated</summary>
          <p>Repeated findings from the same rule in one file have diminishing weight. Actionable findings weigh 3 and advisories 1, normalized against analyzed code lines.</p>
          <p>These results use Code Buster 0.14.4 and Spaghetti Meter 0.1.2. Reproduce the scan with <code>cb review --advisory --verbose --no-cache --allow-empty --format=json</code>.</p>
          <p><a href="/codebuster/docs/reference/reports/#analyzed-source-metrics">Code Buster’s source metrics and finding modes</a> supply the analyzed-line denominator and actionable/advisory distinction used by the app.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="download" aria-labelledby="release-title">
      <div class="wrap release-card">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Spaghetti Meter 0.1.2 · Code Buster 0.14.4</span>
          <h2 id="release-title">Your bowl is ready.</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="button button-primary" href={releaseUrl}>Get v0.1.2 on GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
